<title>UK: CSFB set calls on SGL Carbon and Schwartz Pharma.</title>
<headline>CSFB set calls on SGL Carbon and Schwartz Pharma.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston Effecten GmbH has issued two million American-style call warrants, one million each on SGL Carbon AG and Schwarz Pharma AG, lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.NOV.96-30.DEC.97   PAYDATE	22.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TRANCHE    STRIKE	ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING  SPOT</p>
<p> SGL	  195 DEM     2.71 DEM  18.14 PCT   5.51 X  188 DEM</p>
<p> SCHWARZ    120 DEM     11.89 DEM 18.82 PCT   5.31 X  111 DEM</p>
<p> ONE SHWARZ PHARMA WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> TEN SGL CARBON WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
